  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nAll of the \"#1 Dad\" mugs in the world change to show the actual ranking of Dads suddenly.\n\n\"Daniel, can you come downstairs please?\", my wife asks. \"Yeah, sure!\", I reply.  When she uses that calm quiet voice, it scares me. Something's wrong.  She's sitting at the table, with a look of horror on her face. \"Do you remember the mug that we got my mom yesterday?\" \"Yeah, it said something like \"World's Best Grandma\", I reply. \n\n\"Take a look at these other ones\", Christy says. \n\nI look at them, and suddenly feel notice what she is talking about. Instead of the words, \"World's Best Mom\", it now reads something like, \"World's 112817928th best  Mom\". My mug that used to read #1 dad now says #397898798th best Dad. \n\n\"I think these are the real rankings\", she says.  \"You'll...always be #1 to me?\"",
